# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc19_nz.rpy:673
translate brazil ch2sc19_nz_88d00d7c:

#   my "He can never be what Alice wants him to be until that matter has been resolved, I felt it when I saw him."
    my "Ele nunca poderá ser o que Alice quer que ele seja até que essa questão seja resolvida; eu senti isso quando o vi."

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc19_nz.rpy:674
translate brazil ch2sc19_nz_84c30691:

#   my "Neither you nor I can imagine what that night did to him, losing his parents like that."
    my "Nem você nem eu conseguimos imaginar o que aquela noite fez com ele, perder os pais daquela maneira."

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc19_nz.rpy:675
translate brazil ch2sc19_nz_f04dcf97:

#   my "So stop judging him... yes, I agree that it sucks he had to leave, I wanted him to stay as well."
